n=5, 10 arcs, 1024 tournaments
(1) delta always even: True; Hessian always divisible by 4: False
(2) per-flip #other-arcs-whose-delta-changes: max=9 (of 9); ever ALL 9? True
    (so flipping an arc NEVER changes every other delta — the interaction is sparse)
(3) interaction support vs share-a-vertex: shareV&interact=30, shareV&no=0, disjoint&interact=15, disjoint&no=0
    (interaction ⟺ share an odd cycle; sharing a vertex ⟹ a common triangle ⟹ interact)

